A request about donation links
------------------------------

PocketRadio exists to make public radio easier to listen to, and public radio
runs on listener donations. The curated stations in `curated_stations.json`
each carry a `donateUrl`:

    KCRW              https://join.kcrw.com
    KEXP              https://www.kexp.org/donate
    NPR Hourly News   https://www.npr.org/donations/support

If you fork or redistribute this project, please keep those links working and
reachable from the UI rather than stripping them out.

This is a request, not a license condition. MPL 2.0 section 3.2 does not permit
restricting the rights it grants in covered source code, so this notice adds no
requirement to the license terms above and imposes no obligation on you. It is
asked in good faith, on the expectation that anyone who finds this project
useful shares the reason it was built.
